<title>POLAND: Optimus Q3 net jumps to PLN 2.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Optimus Q3 net jumps to PLN 2.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optimus SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Q3 1996	 Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				5.55   vs    3.08</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  4.43   vs    2.87</p>
<p>    net					2.76   vs    1.65</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Optimus SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    105.05   vs   73.48</p>
<p>    costs of sales			90.25   vs   70.07</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.67   vs    1.22</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.29   vs    0.32</p>
<p>    financial costs			2.41   vs    0.50</p>
<p>    investment			     8.48   vs    4.00</p>
<p>JANUARY - SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>    operating			     15.21   vs    8.35</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 13.99   vs   10.16</p>
<p>    net					8.41   vs    6.04</p>
<p>    net sales			    293.57   vs  192.63</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     255.96   vs  169.50</p>
<p>    income tax			     5.59   vs    4.12</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   4.69   vs    3.09</p>
<p>    financial costs			5.90   vs    1.25</p>
<p>    investment			    12.56   vs    9.86</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
